## Performance Budget
- Bundle < 150KB gzipped
- LCP < 1.5s
- All images lazy-loaded except hero background
- Font: font-display: swap

## API Endpoints (existing backend)
- POST /api/v1/auth/telegram — auth via initData
- POST /api/v1/auth/refresh — refresh tokens
- GET /api/v1/users/me — current user (subscription, coins, limits)
- GET /api/v1/tales — user tales list
- GET /api/v1/tales/:id — single tale
- POST /api/v1/tales/generate — generate tale { theme, with_audio }
- POST /api/v1/tales/generate/named — named tale { name, with_audio }
- POST /api/v1/tales/generate/night — night tale { with_audio }
- GET /api/v1/collection — user collection
- DELETE /api/v1/collection/:id — delete from collection
- POST /api/v1/collection/:id/favorite — toggle favorite
